Z||000003||Raydar||03-30-2001||05:55 PM||||That's the CRX rebody. <BR>Popular in Atlanta.<P>Actually, that car is fairly close to me. I can go and check it out if anybody's interested. I saw the correct (kinda grainy) pic in the Auto Trader. It really is a white 85 GT. Has a wing on the back. <BR>Think it's kinda expensive though, unless it's cherry. <BR><P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 T-top Formula<BR>88 soon-to-be-V6 coupe||||reg||1
